{"track":"python","category":"함수·클래스","level":3,"title":"함수를 n번 적용","desc":"<p>함수 <code>f</code>를 값 <code>x</code>에 <b>n번 연달아</b> 적용한 결과를 돌려주는 <code>apply_n(f, x, n)</code>을 만드세요. <code>n</code>이 0이면 <code>x</code> 그대로예요.</p>","starter":"def apply_n(f, x, n):\n    pass\n","solution":"def apply_n(f, x, n):\n    for _ in range(n):\n        x = f(x)\n    return x\n","hint":"<p>반복할 때마다 결과를 <code>x</code>에 다시 담아요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"apply_n(lambda x: x * 2, 1, 5)","expected":32,"visible":true},{"call":"apply_n(lambda x: x + 3, 0, 4)","expected":12,"visible":true},{"call":"apply_n(lambda x: x + 1, 7, 0)","expected":7,"visible":false},{"call":"apply_n(lambda s: s + \"a\", \"\", 3)","expected":"aaa","visible":false}],"id":"py-083"}